<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="GAL" style="id">- Margi Tiwi Ənga Tǝm [mfm]</book>
  <para style="h">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Gal</para>
  <para style="toc2">Galatiya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsǝfǝ Nǝ Bulusu Anǝ Njir Galatiya</para>
  <para style="mt2">Cama Tsǝtsǝfǝ Nǝ Bulusu Anǝ</para>
  <para style="mt1">Njir Galatiya</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="GAL 1"/>
  <para style="s">Usa Dzau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 1:1"/>Cama tsǝtsǝfau sara ara Bulusu, cama sǝsǝ nǝ Yesu. Aˈyi nji ǝnga alaga ndǝ ngǝ sǝ ɗa mai. Ama Yesu Kǝrsiti ǝnga Hyal Tada ngǝ sǝ ɗa, ndǝra hyaˈana nyi sara vir tau. <verse eid="GAL 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 1:2"/>Naˈya ǝnga patǝkura wazha ama kǝra ǝnga yau, nga vǝr sǝ cama kau, anǝ patǝkura njir nu, njira wu Galatiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 1:3"/>Mayiwakur ǝnga huɗǝ pǝrtǝu sara ara Dǝrmǝn Hyal ǝnga Yesu Kǝrsiti nda nggya ǝnga hyi. <verse eid="GAL 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 1:4"/>Yesu Kǝrsiti lǝr kǝrnyi arya bikǝr mǝn, aga ja mbǝɗana mǝn sara ara nggyabiya ɗǝmwaˈyi kau, ǝnggǝra Hyalǝr mǝn wu yiwu. <verse eid="GAL 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 1:5"/>Bǝgǝ kadakadarkur a nggya nǝ nyi baˈanuwa. Amina.<verse eid="GAL 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vanyi Ndǝshigu Pamǝu Aˈyi Mai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 1:6"/>Sǝra hya vǝr mǝl kau a ɗari sǝr hivǝr gagaɗau anǝ ɗa. Wu pǝci kushu ǝnggǝr kau, kǝja hya piyar nu ndǝra nggar hyi lagu mayiwakur Kǝrsiti, ka tǝkǝri hyi nu vanyi ndǝshigu mafǝliyangǝu. <verse eid="GAL 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 1:7"/>Ya, vanyi ndǝshigu pamǝ aˈyi mai. Yi nar hyi abangau, ara alenyi nju hya hangǝkala hyi, ndu nǝrdzǝ aga nda bǝlana jirkur nǝ ndǝshigu nǝ Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="GAL 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 1:8"/>Ama yu na anǝ hyi, ma vanyi ndǝ aˈyi wu pama ˈya kǝra wu shili ǝnga vanyi ndǝshigu pamǝ a mwara kǝra ˈyi nǝ hyi kau, alaga waladi kǝra sara dǝmǝlmǝ ngau, bǝgǝ nda nyi a ɗa ndǝ shishiˈwau! <verse eid="GAL 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 1:9"/>Ənggǝr kǝra ˈyi nar hyi tsu kaɗǝu, yu ɓǝra nar hyi abangǝ tsu, abǝr kalar ndǝra ɓǝra nar hyi vanyi ndǝshigu pamǝ a mwara kǝra hyi dlǝwuri kau, bǝgǝ ja ɗa ndǝ shishiˈwau!<verse eid="GAL 1:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 1:10"/>Hyu nggani yu gal dlǝwu dzau ara nji ǝndǝga ara Hyal ya? Əndǝga yu gal aga nja fal ɗa ya? Awau! Maja huɗa nji nga yu yiwu ya pina, nayi ɗa ndǝr mǝl thlǝr Kǝrsiti mai.<verse eid="GAL 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ənggǝra Bulusu Ɗa Cama Sǝsau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 1:11"/>Wazha ama, yu yiwu hya sǝni abǝr ndǝshigu kǝra yi tǝtǝlna anǝ hyi kau, aˈyi sara ara ndǝ nga nyi mai. <verse eid="GAL 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 1:12"/>Nayi dlǝwuri sara ara ndǝ mai. Ənga ǝtsu aˈyi ndǝ ngǝ highiɓǝ anǝ ɗa mai. Yesu Kǝrsiti ǝnga kǝrnyi ngǝ cabiya ɗa.<verse eid="GAL 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 1:13"/>A nggari hyi culi nggyabiya ɗa kǝra ɗǝɗǝmǝu, wu sǝr nu nǝ njir Yahudiya, ǝnggǝra yi nǝ nyi ɓwaɓwatǝ gagaɗǝ anǝ njir nu Hyal ǝnga jirkur. Kǝra tǝkǝri yu yiwu aga ya tǝtǝlna kǝra njir nuwur nda. <verse eid="GAL 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 1:14"/>Nahyi tsu, a sǝnǝr hyi ǝnggǝra yi nu sǝra njir Yahudiya wu nu. Yu ndiya badǝgala njir Yahudiya njira ˈyi hǝ wu nu sǝr ciji ǝnga nda ǝnga ɗǝfu hamu.<verse eid="GAL 1:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 1:15"/>Ama Hyal wu mayiwakur nyi, ji caɗǝbiya ɗa kadivira nji ya ɗa. Ənga ǝtsu ji ngga ɗa, ba ji <verse eid="GAL 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 1:16"/>pahǝna liya yau aga ya lari Zǝr nyi. Ənga aga ya tǝtǝlna ndǝshigu mǝsahǝu anǝ njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai. Ar pǝci ta, nayi gal sǝmana ara ndǝ mai, <verse eid="GAL 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 1:17"/>ǝnga tsu nayi maˈyi a vu Urshalima a vu gya njira ɗa cama sǝsǝ a mwara yi mai. Ənggǝrna ba yi maˈyi a ndar ˈyiˈyir njir Arabiya, ǝnggau ba yi sha shili wu mǝlmǝ Damasǝkasu. <verse eid="GAL 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 1:18"/>Kǝl ayukuɗa fa makǝru, ba yi maˈyi a vu Urshalima aga ya vuwa lari Kefasu, naja ngǝ Simanu Biturusu. Ətsu kǝ yi mǝliya pida kumou apǝ tǝfu nga ja. <verse eid="GAL 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 1:19"/>Ar pǝci ta, nayi lari alaga ndǝ zǝmǝ wu pama cama sǝsǝ mai, kǝl Yakubu zamiya Thlagǝu. <verse eid="GAL 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 1:20"/>Ənga jiri yu nar hyi wu mwar Hyal, sǝra ya vǝr tsǝfau anǝ hyi kau, aˈyi fati mai.<verse eid="GAL 1:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 1:21"/>Ayukuɗǝ tsu, kǝ yi maˈyi a ndar ˈyiˈyir Sǝriya, ǝnga ˈyiˈyir Silisiya. <verse eid="GAL 1:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 1:22"/>Ama ar pǝci ta, njir nu Kǝrsiti kǝra aˈyi wu ˈyiˈyir Yahudi, nandǝ wu sǝn ɗa bama ǝnga bama kwatahǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 1:23"/>Nanda tsu a nggar nda, nji na, “Ndǝra ɗǝɗǝmǝ ji lǝr ɓwaɓwatǝ anǝ ˈya, kabangǝkau, kǝja ju na ndǝr mbǝrsa ar kǝra ndǝr kǝra ɗǝɗǝmǝ ju dza!” <verse eid="GAL 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 1:24"/>Kǝ ndǝ fal Hyal arya sǝra ji mǝl lagu ɗa.<verse eid="GAL 1:24"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="GAL 2"/>
  <para style="s">Alenyi Cama Sǝsau Hǝnggǝri Ənga Bulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 2:1"/>Ayukuɗa fa kumou apǝ foɗǝu, yi ɓǝra sha a vu Urshalima. Wu pǝci kau, nayi ǝnga Barnabasu ngǝ maˈyi, ba tsu ˈyi hǝri Tayitusu. <verse eid="GAL 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 2:2"/>Yi maˈyi a ndara nda ara Hyal ngǝ cabiya ɗa wu mǝtakǝr aga ya maˈyi. Ta yi nda, ba yi nda ɓǝ ǝkkǝˈyi alenyi njir tǝɗǝmwa nǝ njir nu Yesu, ba yi cabiya nda zhizhir nda ar kǝra ndǝshigu kǝra yi tǝtǝlna anǝ njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai. Yi cabiya nda najaka sau, aga ya sǝnbiya abǝr nayi ǝnga nda a hǝnggǝr ˈya ar kǝra thlǝr kau, ǝnga a sara nǝrdzǝ ɗa wu thlǝr kǝra ya vǝr mǝl ǝnga kǝra yi mǝlna a ɗa sǝ kurthlǝu. <verse eid="GAL 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 2:3"/>Alaga bazhi ɓǝ ɗa Tayitusu kǝra ndǝr Gǝrikǝ ngau, nji aˈyi ciwa nyi aga nja thlana nyi pǝlzha mai. <verse eid="GAL 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 2:4"/>Ndǝr ar kǝra thla pǝlzha kǝ hyaˈari sara ara njir nu nǝ fafati kǝra shili ɗǝɗǝwa. Ndǝ shili wu pama ˈya aga nda sa tsambiya nggyabiyar ˈya wu Kǝrsiti Yesu, aga nda ɓǝra shabiya ˈya aga mafa. <verse eid="GAL 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 2:5"/>Ama alaga kushu naˈyi hǝnggǝri ǝnga nda mai, arya ˈyu yiwu ˈya tsǝrpǝr hyi jirkura ndǝshigu kau.<verse eid="GAL 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 2:6"/>Ama alaga njir tǝɗǝmwar nda, nandǝ cakǝri sǝ ar kǝra sǝra yi highiɓǝ kǝ mai, (wu ɗǝnga ɗa alaga wa nga nda, patǝ lagu zǝmǝ nga nda anǝ ɗa, arya Hyal wu ca pampamǝkur mai). <verse eid="GAL 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 2:7"/>Nanda ǝnga kǝrnda tsu a lar nda ǝnggǝra Hyal hǝnggǝri ji nǝ ɗa thlǝr tǝtǝlna ndǝshigu anǝ njira gǝra aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai, ǝnggǝr kǝra ji nǝ nyi anǝ Biturusu thlǝr tǝtǝlna ndǝshigu anǝ njir Yahudiya. <verse eid="GAL 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 2:8"/>Kǝja Hyal kǝra mǝl thlǝr lagur Biturusu aga mǝl thlǝr anǝ njir Yahudiya, naja tsu ngǝ mǝl thlǝr lagu ɗa aga ya ɗa cama sǝsau anǝ njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai.<verse eid="GAL 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 2:9"/>Ənggǝra ndǝ lar ǝnggǝra Hyal cabiya ɗa mayiwakur nyi abangau, ba Yakubu, ǝnga Biturusu, ba Yahwana hǝnggǝri ǝnga yau. Nanda kǝra njir tǝɗǝmwa anǝ njir nu Yesu, ndǝ dlǝwur ˈya ǝnga Barnabasu ǝnga huɗǝ zǝmǝu. ˈYi hǝnggǝri wu pama ˈya aga ˈya maˈyi a ndǝgya njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai, ǝnga nanda tsu nda maˈyi a ndǝgya njir Yahudiya. <verse eid="GAL 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 2:10"/>Kǝl kǝ ndǝ ɗǝngari ˈya abǝr ˈya sara fari ǝnga nji ɗaɗali kǝra wu pama nda mai. Alaga kǝ tsu kaɗǝu ya vǝr cim ya mǝl abangau.<verse eid="GAL 2:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bulusu Kughiya Biturusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 2:11"/>Ar pǝci kǝra Biturusu shili wu mǝlmǝ Antakiya, kǝ yi kughiya nyi a du bama ja, arya sǝr mǝla ja aˈyi tsaˈa mai. <verse eid="GAL 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 2:12"/>Tsu kaɗǝu ju sǝm sǝr sǝm ǝnga njir nu Yesu njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai. Ama ayukuɗa shilǝr njira Yakubu sǝwa a shili wu Antakiya, kǝ Biturusu tsana dzau, ji ɗa pamǝu. Ji mǝl abangau arya ju hivǝr njira wu yiwu nja thlana nyi pǝlzha anǝ njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai.<verse eid="GAL 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 2:13"/>Abangǝ ma alenyi njir Yahudiya njir nu Yesu mǝl culi najaka ngguta vi ǝnggǝr nǝ Biturusu kau. Sǝr mǝla nda kǝ tsu ma, ka bǝlana hangǝkala Barnabasu. <verse eid="GAL 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 2:14"/>Ama ta yi lari sǝr mǝla nda aˈyi wu nu jirkur nǝ ndǝshigu mai, kǝ yi kughiya Biturusu wu mwar nji patǝu, “Nagau, ndǝr Yahudiya ngau, ama kǝja gu nggya ǝnggǝr njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai. Nagǝ aˈyi wu nggya ǝnggǝr njir Yahudiya mai. Aga mi nga gu ca njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai, aga nda nu sǝr ciji nǝ Yahudiya ka?”<verse eid="GAL 2:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 2:15"/>“Alaga kǝ namǝn njir Yahudiya ngau lagur ya, aˈyi njira gǝra njir Yahudiya njir bikǝ mai, <verse eid="GAL 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 2:16"/>wu sǝn mǝn abǝr ndǝ aˈyi a sǝn uya nggya tsapǝu wu mwar Hyal lagur nu dlaɗǝ mai, kǝl ma ji mbǝrsa ǝnga Yesu Kǝrsiti. Agabangau, namǝn ma a lǝr mǝn kǝrmǝn anǝ Kǝrsiti Yesu, aga mǝna ɗa nji tsapǝu wu mwar Hyal lagur mbǝrsa ǝnga Kǝrsiti ama aˈyi lagur nu dlaɗǝ mai. Arya ndǝ a sǝn uya nggya tsapǝ wu mwar Hyal lagur nu dlaɗǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 2:17"/>Ama ar pǝcira mǝn wu yiwu mǝna ɗa nji tsapǝu wu mwar Hyal lagur mbǝrsa wu Kǝrsiti, ama ba nji thlǝwa mǝn ǝnga kǝrmǝn njir bikau. Kǝ a cabiyari abǝr Kǝrsiti wu tsǝtsǝku aga nja mǝl bikǝ ya? Awau, alaga kushu!<verse eid="GAL 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 2:18"/>“Ama ma yi ɓǝra hǝr sǝra yi vakana tsu kaɗǝu a cabiyari abǝr nayi ndǝr ɓǝl dlaɗǝ ngau. <verse eid="GAL 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 2:19"/>Lagu nu dlaɗau, a ɗar yi tǝtau anǝ dlaɗau, aga ya nggya nǝ Hyal. <verse eid="GAL 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 2:20"/>A dlakǝya ɗar nji ǝnga Kǝrsiti. Kabangǝkau, aˈyi mbǝmbǝɗǝ nga nyi mai, ama Kǝrsiti ngu nggya wu yau. Najaka nggya kǝra yu nggya wu kumǝr dzau, nggya nǝ mbǝrsa ǝnga Zǝr Hyal, ndǝra yiwu ɗa ba ji tau arya yau. <verse eid="GAL 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 2:21"/>Nayi wu piyari mayiwakur nǝ Hyal mai. Arya ma ndu sǝn uya nggya tsapǝ wu mwar Hyal lagur nu dlaɗau, ka cabiyari abǝr tǝr Kǝrsiti a ɗari sǝ kurthlǝu.”<verse eid="GAL 2:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="GAL 3"/>
  <para style="s">Nu Dlaɗau Əndǝga Mbǝrsa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 3:1"/>Nahyi njir Galatiya, thlǝkǝ wu tǝ hyi ya? Əndǝga vanyi ndǝ gwaɗǝr kǝra hyi ya? Kǝja ar babal nga yi cabiya hyi Yesu Kǝrsiti ndǝra tǝ ar wu dladlakau. <verse eid="GAL 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 3:2"/>Kabangǝkau, yu yiwu ya yiwar hyi vanyi sau. Mambǝl Hyal shida ar kǝra hyi arya hyi nu dlaɗǝ ya, ǝndǝga ara hyi hǝnggǝri ǝnga ndǝr kǝra hyi nggari ya? <verse eid="GAL 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 3:3"/>Kabangǝkau, thlǝkǝ wu tǝ hyi ya? Kǝja hyi dzǝguya wu Mambǝl, ama kǝja hya ɓǝra jamuya wu ndǝndǝkur! <verse eid="GAL 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 3:4"/>Ya, culi ɓwaɓwatǝ pamǝpamǝ kǝ hyi sǝsǝˈwuri kau, a ɗari sǝ kurthlǝ ya? Aˈyi a kyau, abangǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 3:5"/>Hyu nggani Hyal nǝ hyi Mambǝl nyi, ǝnga ju mǝl sǝ dǝdǝgurˈyar wu pama hyi ara hyu nu dlaɗǝ ya, ǝndǝga ara hyi hǝnggǝri ǝnga ndǝr Kǝrsiti kǝra hyi nggar ya?<verse eid="GAL 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 3:6"/>Tsamiya mǝ nggyar Ibrahimu ja. Nji tsǝfǝri abǝr, “Arya Ibrahimu mbǝrsa ǝnga Hyal, kǝ Hyal jigǝwa nyi ar viya ndǝ tsapǝu.” <verse eid="GAL 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 3:7"/>Hya sǝnbiya abǝr njira hǝnggǝri ǝnga Hyal, nanda ngǝ culi Ibrahimu. <verse eid="GAL 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 3:8"/>Lǝkakaɗǝ nǝ Hyal a nanari tsu kaɗǝu, abǝr, Hyal wu nda mǝliya njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai a uya nggya nǝ tsapǝkur lagur mbǝrsa. Arya tsu kaɗǝu, Hyal nar nyi anǝ Ibrahimu lagu ndǝshigu, abǝr, “Lagu ngau, ngǝ patǝr ˈyiˈyi wu nda uya barka.” <verse eid="GAL 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 3:9"/>Hyal fǝnggǝr nyi barka anǝ Ibrahimu arya mbǝrsa nyi, agabangǝ kalar ndǝra mbǝrsa ǝnga Hyal, ju nda fǝnggǝr nda barka daɓǝ ǝnga Ibrahimu.<verse eid="GAL 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 3:10"/>Kalar njira wu nggani abǝr nu dlaɗǝ nǝ Musa ngu mǝliya tsapǝu, a ɗar nda nji shishiˈwau. Ara ndǝr Hyal kǝra tsǝtsǝfǝ nana, abǝr, “Kalar ndǝra gǝra nubiya patǝr sǝra tsǝtsǝfau, wu Lǝkakaɗǝ nǝ dlaɗau, a ɗar ja ndǝ shishiˈwau.” <verse eid="GAL 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 3:11"/>Ar babal nga nyi, ndǝ aˈyi a sǝn uya nggya tsapǝ wu mwar Hyal lagur nu dlaɗǝ mai, arya tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi abǝr, “Ndǝ tsapǝu, wu uya mbǝɗau lagur mbǝrsa.” <verse eid="GAL 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 3:12"/>Sǝr daɓǝri nu dlaɗau ǝnga mbǝrsa aˈyi mai. Ənggǝr kǝra nji tsǝfǝri, “Kalar ndǝra nubiya patǝr sǝra nji nana wu dlaɗau, ju mbǝɗau laguwa nyi.”<verse eid="GAL 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 3:13"/>Kǝrsiti a bǝliya mǝn ri sara wu shiˈwu nǝ dlaɗau. Arya tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi abǝr, “Kalar ndǝra nji dlakǝya ar wu dladlakau, a ɗari ja shishiˈwau.” <verse eid="GAL 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 3:14"/>Kǝrsiti a bǝliyar nji aga njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai a uya barka nǝ Ibrahimu, aga mǝna uya Mambǝl kǝra Hyal mǝliya alkawal lagur mbǝrsa.<verse eid="GAL 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pampamǝkura Dlaɗau Ənga Alkawal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 3:15"/>Wazha ama, bǝgǝ ya nar hyi karapǝ ar kǝra sǝra hyi tsǝliya. Ma alkawal kǝra nji mbiya, nji fuwa tsi a gwa, ǝnga nji hǝnggǝri ni, ndǝr sǝn pǝlna ǝnga ja cakǝri aˈyi mai. <verse eid="GAL 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 3:16"/>Agabangau, alkawal ngǝ Hyal mǝliya ǝnga Ibrahimu ba culi nyi. Aˈyi nji tsǝfǝri abǝr, “Culi nyiˈyar mai,” kǝra wu cabiya abǝr nji gangǝ ngau. Awau, ama ji na “Culi ngau,” kǝra cabiya ndǝ zǝmǝ ngau, ca ngǝ Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="GAL 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 3:17"/>Sǝra yu na ca ngǝ, dlaɗǝ kǝra shili ayukuɗa fa gharu foɗǝu ǝnga makǝr kumou nyi nǝ alkawal, a sǝn mǝliya alkawal kǝra Hyal mbiya wu pama ja ǝnga Ibrahimu ja ɗa sǝ kurthlǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 3:18"/>Maja abǝr nju uya barka kau, lagur nu dlaɗau, naji ɓǝra ɗa lagur alkawal mai. Hyal nǝ nyi barka anǝ Ibrahimu lagur alkawal kau.<verse eid="GAL 3:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 3:19"/>Ma abangǝ ja, aga mi ngǝ Dlaɗǝ shila? Nji shili ǝnga Dlaɗǝ aga ja cabiya mǝn bikǝr mǝn ar babal, kǝl pǝcira alkawal kǝra wu shili lagu culi Ibrahimu kǝ nyabiya dzau. Dlaɗau, waladiˈyar ngǝ shili ni, lagur ndǝr taˈyau wu pama Hyal ǝnga nji. <verse eid="GAL 3:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 3:20"/>Ndǝr taˈyi wu pama nji ǝnga Hyal, a sǝn ɗa ja taˈyi ar kǝra ndǝ zǝmǝ mai, ama Hyal zǝmǝ nga ja.<verse eid="GAL 3:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sǝra Dlaɗǝ Cabiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 3:21"/>Ɗǝm ya, dlaɗǝ wu ɗa dawa ǝnga alkawal Hyal ya? Awau, alaga kushu! Arya maja abǝr dlaɗǝ wu sǝn shili ǝnga pi, tsapǝkur ma nju sǝn uya lagu dlaɗau. <verse eid="GAL 3:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 3:22"/>Ama tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi wu Ndǝr Hyal, abǝr, duniya patǝ mafa bikǝ nga nda. Sǝkǝ ɗa abangǝ aga sǝra nji hǝr alkawala nyi lagur mbǝrsa wu Yesu Kǝrsiti, nja lǝri anǝ njira hǝnggǝri.<verse eid="GAL 3:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 3:23"/>Divira mbǝrsa shili, dlaɗau, a mbiya mǝn ri wu fursǝna, lagur biya aˈyi mai, kǝl lagur mbǝrsa ǝnga Yesu cabiya dzau. <verse eid="GAL 3:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 3:24"/>Nji fuwa mǝn wu tsa dlaɗau aga ja hǝr mǝna ndǝgya Kǝrsiti. Lagu kau, nga mǝn wu uya nggya tsapǝu, wu mwar Hyal lagur mbǝrsa. <verse eid="GAL 3:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 3:25"/>Kabangǝkǝ tsu, pǝcir mbǝrsa a shilǝri, tsu mǝn aˈyi ǝgyakiɗa dlaɗǝ mai.<verse eid="GAL 3:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wazha Hyal</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 3:26"/>Lagur mbǝrsa wu Kǝrsiti Yesu ngǝ patǝkura hyi nggya wazha Hyal. <verse eid="GAL 3:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 3:27"/>Abangǝ tsu nahyi njira nji mǝliya hyi baɓǝtizǝma, a ɗar hyi nǝ Kǝrsiti, sǝr mǝla hyi ja ɗa sǝr mǝla Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="GAL 3:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 3:28"/>Agabangau, pampamǝkur aˈyi mai wu pama njira njir Yahudiya ǝnga njira aˈyi njir Yahudiya mai. Ətsu njira mafa ǝnga kambǝr nji mai, ǝnga mala ǝnga sal. Patǝkura hyi nji zǝmǝ nga hyu Kǝrsiti Yesu. <verse eid="GAL 3:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 3:29"/>Ma tsu nǝ Kǝrsiti nga hyi, a ɗar hyi culi nǝ Ibrahimu, ǝtsu hyu nda dlǝwuri sǝr faˈa ki kǝra Hyal mǝliya alkawala nyi.<verse eid="GAL 3:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="GAL 4"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 4:1"/>Sǝra yu na ca ngǝ, ar pǝcira ndǝr faˈa ki ar viya zǝr ngau, aˈyi ja pamǝ a mwa ara mafa mai, alaga kǝ naja ngǝ ǝnga ki kǝ papatǝu. <verse eid="GAL 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 4:2"/>Əgya kiɗa njira hǝ nyi ǝnga njira dǝnyi fuwa kar nyi wu tsa nda baˈanǝ shili ar pǝcira dǝnyi fiya. <verse eid="GAL 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 4:3"/>Abangǝ nga nyi tsu anǝ mǝn, ar pǝci kǝra mǝn tsu wazha divira Kǝrsiti cabiya dzau, namǝn ǝnggǝr mafa anǝ sǝra a vǝr sǝm tǝlkur ar kǝra duniya. <verse eid="GAL 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 4:4"/>Ama wu pǝci kǝra Hyal pabǝri nyabiya dzau, kǝ Hyal sǝwa Zǝr nyi. Ji shili lagu mala. Nji ya nyi ǝgyakiɗa dǝnama nǝ dlaɗau, <verse eid="GAL 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 4:5"/>aga ja bǝliya njira ǝgyakiɗa dlaɗau, ǝnga ja shabiya mǝn ar viya wazha Hyal. <verse eid="GAL 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 4:6"/>Arya namǝn wazha Hyal, ca ngǝ Hyal sǝwa Mambǝl Zǝr nyi wu ɗǝfuwa mǝn, aga ja nǝ mǝn dǝnama nǝ ngga Hyal, “Abba, Tada!” <verse eid="GAL 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 4:7"/>Kabangǝkau, tsu nahyi aˈyi mafa mai, ama wazha nga hyi. Ta ɗari wazha nga hyi, Hyal wu nda mǝliya hya ɗa ndǝr faˈa ki.<verse eid="GAL 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nggyabiya Njir Galatiya Nǝ Nyi Ɗǝnga Sau Anǝ Bulusu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 4:8"/>Ɗǝɗǝmǝu, ar pǝcira hyi gǝra sǝn Hyal, hyu sǝm mafakur anǝ katǝˈyar, kǝra gǝra ar viya sau. <verse eid="GAL 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 4:9"/>Ama kabangǝkǝ kǝra hyu sǝn Hyal, ǝndǝga Hyal ngu sǝn hyi. Mi ngǝ ɗa hyu ɓǝra sha a ndǝgya kiɗa tǝlkur kǝra gǝra ǝnga dǝnama? Sǝ gǝra kǝr nga nda, mi ngǝ ɗa hyu yiwu hya ɓǝra sha aga mafar nda? <verse eid="GAL 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 4:10"/>Kǝja hyu lǝr kǝrhyi aga ɓǝla alenyi pidaˈyar ǝnga hyaˈyar, ǝnga pǝci pamǝpamǝ ba faˈyar. <verse eid="GAL 4:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 4:11"/>Sǝra hyu mǝl kau a nǝ ɗari ɗǝnga sau, ara a ɗari ǝnggǝr patǝr ɓwaɓwatǝ kǝra yi sa ar kǝra hyi kau sǝ kurthlǝu ngau!<verse eid="GAL 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 4:12"/>Yu kǝdi hyi wazha ama, hya nggya ǝnggǝr nayau. Arya nayi ǝnga kǝrɗa ǝnggǝr nahyi nga yau. Sǝ aˈyi hyi ndzana ɗa mai. <verse eid="GAL 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 4:13"/>A sǝn hyi shilǝgǝ kǝra uya ɗa, naja ngǝ mǝliya lagu kǝra yi hǝri hyi ndǝshigu nǝ tanggǝrma. <verse eid="GAL 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 4:14"/>Alaga kǝ shilǝgǝ kau ɗa sǝr ɓwakǝr dǝdǝgalǝu anǝ hyi, alaga abangau nahyi diɗana ɗa mai, ǝnga hyi nggǝl ara dlǝwu ɗa mai. Hyi dlǝwuri ɗa ǝnggǝr waladi sara ara Hyal, ǝnggǝr Kǝrsiti Yesu ǝnga kǝrnyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 4:15"/>Hyi ɗa ǝnga caguli gagaɗau ar pǝci ta! Kabangǝkǝ ya, ǝmani ngǝ cagulir hyi ta? Pakatǝ ar pǝci ta, wu sǝn yau, abǝr hyu sǝn tǝkuɗǝbiya liya hyi, ba hya nǝ ɗa! <verse eid="GAL 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 4:16"/>Ya, hyi shabiya ɗa dawar hyi arya yi nar hyi jiri ya?<verse eid="GAL 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 4:17"/>Njiˈyar kau, ndu yiwu nda kaghibiya hyi, ama aˈyi wu mǝnahǝkur mai. Ndu yiwu nda tǝkǝbiya hyi ǝnga yau, aga patǝr ɗǝngar hyi nda sha a ndǝgya nda. <verse eid="GAL 4:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 4:18"/>Ma ɗǝngar nji mǝnahǝ nga nyi, a ɗar mǝnahǝ cimu nda cabiya yiwu wu gau, aˈyi kǝl pǝcira yi ǝnga hyi waci mai. <verse eid="GAL 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 4:19"/>Nahyi wazha ɗa, kǝra yi ɓǝra dar tsǝkar ya nda, kǝl Kǝrsiti ciya dzau wu ɗǝfuwa hyi. <verse eid="GAL 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 4:20"/>Cim ɗa ya nggya ǝnga hyi baˈanǝ kabangǝkau, ba ya bǝlana ɗaha yau, arya aˈyi yi ǝnga ɗǝnga sǝ gagaɗau ar kǝra hyi!<verse eid="GAL 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Karapau Ar kǝra Hajaratu Ənga Saratu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 4:21"/>Nahyi, hya nar ɗa, nahyi njir yiwu nu dlaɗau, a sǝnbiyar hyi sǝra dlaɗau wu na ya? <verse eid="GAL 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 4:22"/>Tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi abǝr Ibrahimu aˈyi ja ǝnga wazha shili mǝthlǝu, pathlǝu, zǝr kǝra nji ya lagu mala mafa, ǝnga vanyi tsu lagu kambǝr mala. <verse eid="GAL 4:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 4:23"/>Zǝr kǝra ji yabiya ǝnga mala mafa kau, nji yabiya nyi lagura nji tsǝliya. Ama zǝr kambǝr mala kau, nji yabiya nyi lagur alkawal kǝra Hyal mbiya. <verse eid="GAL 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 4:24"/>Najakau, karapǝ ngau, mathlǝkǝˈyi kǝ mǝthlǝu kǝ cabiya alkawal mbamba mǝthlǝu. Hajaratu ngǝ cabiya ndǝr ya mafa, naja ngǝ alkawal mbamba nǝ Mǝ Sǝnayu. <verse eid="GAL 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 4:25"/>Kabangǝkau, Hajaratu a nggyari ar viya Mǝ Sǝnayu kǝra wu ˈyiˈyir Arabiya. Naja ngǝ ar viya mǝlmǝ nǝ Urshalima kabangǝkau, arya naja ǝnga wazha nyi patǝ mafa nga nda. <verse eid="GAL 4:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 4:26"/>Ama Urshalima kǝra a dǝmǝlmau, kambǝr ndǝ ngau, ǝtsu naja ngǝ mǝr mǝn. <verse eid="GAL 4:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="GAL 4:27"/>Tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi abǝr,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">“Ga ɗa ǝnga huɗǝ pǝrtǝu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">nagǝ mala kǝra gǝra ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Ga wau nǝ caguli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">nagǝ ndǝra gǝra nggari kwakwaɗǝ nǝ ya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="GAL 4:27">Arya wazha mala hya a ɗari nda gangǝu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="GAL 4:27">A ndiyar nda mala mayiwa.”<verse eid="GAL 4:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="GAL 4:28"/>Kabangǝkau, wazha ama, Hyal a mǝliya mǝn ri ǝnggǝr Ishaku, wazha nǝ alkawal. <verse eid="GAL 4:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="GAL 4:29"/>Ar pǝci ta tsu zǝr kǝra nji ya wu lagur kǝra nji tsǝliya, ji nǝ nyi ɓwaɓwatǝ anǝ zǝr kǝra nji ya ǝnga dǝnama nǝ Mambǝl Hyal. Abangǝ nga nyi baˈanǝ kabangǝkau. <verse eid="GAL 4:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="GAL 4:30"/>Ama tsǝtsǝfǝ nga nyi wu Lǝkakaɗǝ nǝ Hyal abǝr, “Ga kǝdlǝna mafa kau ǝnga zǝr nyi, ara zǝr mafa kau aˈyi wu tǝkǝ sǝr faˈa ki ǝnga nǝ zǝr kambǝr mala mai.” <verse eid="GAL 4:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="GAL 4:31"/>Agabangau, wazha ama, aˈyi mǝn wazha mala mafa mai, ama namǝn wazha kambǝr mala ngau.<verse eid="GAL 4:31"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="GAL 5"/>
  <para style="s">Kambǝkur Wu Kǝrsiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 5:1"/>Aga nggya kambǝkur ngǝ sǝra ɗa Kǝrsiti pǝliya mǝn, arya kau kǝl hyi taˈyi ǝnga dǝnama, a sara hya ɓǝra shabiya kǝrhyi anǝ ɓwaɓwatǝ nǝ mafakur dlaɗǝ mai.<verse eid="GAL 5:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 5:2"/>Hya nggar ɗa. Nayi Bulusu yu na anǝ hyi, ma hyi hǝnggǝri nja thlana hyi pǝlzha, najakǝ wu ca abǝr Kǝrsiti aˈyi ǝnga akkǝri anǝ hyi mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 5:3"/>Yu ɓǝra ɗǝngari hyi abǝr kalar ndǝra hǝnggǝri ja nu dlaɗǝ nǝ thla pǝlzha, yau, a ɗari anǝ nyi tsaˈa ja nu patǝr sǝra dlaɗǝ nana. <verse eid="GAL 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 5:4"/>Nahyi kǝra wu nǝrdzau hya uya tsapǝkur wu mwar Hyal lagu nu dlaɗau, a ɗari, a thlǝnar hyi kǝrhyi sara wu nu Kǝrsiti ja. A sanar hyi dzau ara mayiwakur Hyal. <verse eid="GAL 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 5:5"/>Ama lagur Mambǝl ǝnga mbǝrsa nga mǝn wu sǝkǝ daɓǝ ǝnga fǝr kǝr aga Kǝrsiti a nǝ mǝn tsapǝkur nyi. <verse eid="GAL 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 5:6"/>Arya ma mǝn wu Kǝrsiti Yesu, alaga pǝlzha, alaga gǝra pǝlzha, aˈyi vanyi sǝ mai. Ama sǝra mǝna tsamǝ, ca ngǝ mbǝrsa mǝn kǝra wu cabiya dzǝ lagur yiwudzau.<verse eid="GAL 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 5:7"/>Tanggǝrma hya vǝr dumwa gagaɗau. Wa ngǝ kar hyi ara nu nǝ jijira? <verse eid="GAL 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 5:8"/>Kadzangǝ ngguta vi kǝra shili anǝ hyi, aˈyi sara ara Hyal kǝra ngga hyi kǝ ngǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 5:9"/>Ənggǝr kǝra nju sǝn na, “Thlǝlamǝ kǝra kushu a sǝn mǝliya macikǝl ja thlǝthlau.” <verse eid="GAL 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 5:10"/>Papalkur kǝrɗa wu thlǝr Thlagǝu, a hǝnggǝr yi abǝr nahyi ɓǝra nu vanyi ɗahǝ pamǝ a ndiya nǝɗa mai. Ətsu kalar ndǝra wu hyaˈa hangǝkala hyi, ju nda sa ɓwaɓwatǝu, alaga wa nga ja.<verse eid="GAL 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 5:11"/>Wazha ama, ma baˈanǝ kabangǝkau, yu tǝtǝlna ndǝr Hyal abǝr aga nja thla pǝlzha, ya, mi ngǝ ɗa baˈanǝ kabangǝkǝ tsu nju lǝ ɓwaɓwatǝ anǝ ɗa? Ma yu dlǝwa nji abǝr a ɗari tsaˈa nja thla pǝlzha, ndǝr ɗa ar kǝra tǝr Kǝrsiti ar wu dladlakǝ aˈyi a ɓǝra sǝn ɗa sǝr thlǝ hi anǝ kalar ndǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 5:12"/>Ar kǝra njira wu hya hangǝkala hyi abǝr kǝl nji thlana hyi pǝlzha, kuji anǝ nda nyi nja thlabiya nyi aga mǝciˈu sal!<verse eid="GAL 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 5:13"/>Nahyi, wazha ama, a ngga hyir nji aga kambǝkur ar kǝra dlaɗau. Hya hangǝkal a sara ɗa kambǝkur hyi kau, ja ɗa nǝ sǝr cim nǝ kumǝr dzau. Ar viya kau, bǝgǝ kambǝkur hyi, ja ɗa kǝra wu hǝri hyi a ndu yiwu mǝl thlǝr nǝ yiwudzau. <verse eid="GAL 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 5:14"/>Arya patǝkura dlaɗau, a daɓǝr nju ɗahǝ zǝmǝu, ca ngǝ, “Ga yiwu tǝwul ngau ǝnggǝr kǝrngau.” <verse eid="GAL 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 5:15"/>Ama ma hyu par kǝrhyi ǝnga hyu nggal kǝrhyi ǝnggǝr maˈwi tagǝu, hya nggya ǝnga hangǝkal ja, ma aˈyi mai patǝkura hyi, hyu sanakǝr!<verse eid="GAL 5:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nggya Lagu Mambǝl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 5:16"/>Sǝra yu yiwu ya na kau, ca ngǝ hya nǝ nyi lagu anǝ Mambǝl Hyal ja lǝ hyi. Ma hyi mǝl abangau nahyi wu nda nggya wu ndǝndǝkur mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 5:17"/>Arya nggya nǝ ndǝndǝkur dawa nga ja anǝ Mambǝl, Mambǝl tsu, dawa nga ja anǝ nggya nǝ ndǝndǝkur. Culi najaka nggya tsu dawa nga nda ǝnga kǝrnda. Ca ngǝ ɗa nahyi wu sǝn mǝliya sǝra hyu yiwu hya mǝl mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 5:18"/>Ma Mambǝl Hyal ngu lǝ hyi, nahyi aˈyi hyi ǝgya dlaɗǝ mai.<verse eid="GAL 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="GAL 5:19"/>Sǝr mǝla ndǝr bikau, ar babal nga nda. Nanda ngǝ sǝsukur, ǝnga mǝl sǝ gǝra kyau, <verse eid="GAL 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="GAL 5:20"/>ǝnga mǝl thlǝr katǝu, ǝnga dǝshakur, ǝnga piyari shishir dza kuvwar nda, ǝnga pa wu pamǝ ǝnga ɗa shishi ǝnga tsu ɗǝfu, ǝnga yiwukǝr ba tǝkǝbiya dzau, ǝnga hya hangǝkala nji, <verse eid="GAL 5:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="GAL 5:21"/>ǝnga shishikur, ba ǝnga sa sǝ sasa, ǝnga alenyi sǝ kǝra papa ˈyar kǝ tsu. Yu kughi anǝ hyi, ǝnggǝr kǝra yi nar hyi tsu kaɗǝu, abǝr njir mǝl najaka sau, nandǝ wu gwu tǝlkur Hyal mai.<verse eid="GAL 5:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="GAL 5:22"/>Ama wazha kǝra Mambǝl wu ya, nanda ngǝ yiwudzau, ǝnga caguli, ǝnga huɗǝ pǝrtǝu, ba sǝsǝˈwu sau, ǝnga hangǝkalkur, ba mǝnahǝkur, ǝnga tsaˈa miya ɗǝfukur, <verse eid="GAL 5:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="GAL 5:23"/>ba ɓatsǝkur kǝr, ba tsu sha yi anǝ sǝra kumǝr dzǝ wu yiwu. Sǝˈyar kau, aˈyi dawa anǝ dlaɗǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="GAL 5:24"/>Patǝkura njira nǝ Kǝrsiti Yesu ngau, a tsǝyar nda nggyabiya nǝ ndǝndǝkur ǝnga sǝ ɗǝmwaˈyiˈyar pamǝpamǝ kǝra dza ndu yiwu. <verse eid="GAL 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="GAL 5:25"/>Ta ɗa Mambǝl ngǝ nǝ mǝn pi, bǝgǝ Mambǝl tsu ja lǝbiya mǝn wu kalar nggyar mǝn. <verse eid="GAL 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="GAL 5:26"/>A sara mǝna ɗa njir hakǝr mai, alaga njir tsǝtsǝbwar kǝrnda, ǝndǝga njir ɗa shishi kǝrnda.<verse eid="GAL 5:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="GAL 6"/>
  <para style="s">Hya Dlǝwar Kǝrhyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="GAL 6:1"/>Wazha ama, ma nji lar vanyi ndǝ a vǝr mǝl bikau, nahyi kǝra nyinyau ǝnga Mambǝl Cicau wu pama nda, bǝgǝ hya shabiya nda a shili ǝnga hangǝkal. Ama hya mǝl abangau ǝnga hangǝkal tsu, ara a vǝr sha zamǝr hyi a shili wu lagu, ba hya tǝɗau a gwu dzau. <verse eid="GAL 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="GAL 6:2"/>Hya dlǝwar kuvwar hyi lagur hǝ ɓwaɓwatǝr nda. Lagu kǝ nga hyu nyabiya dlaɗǝ nǝ Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="GAL 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="GAL 6:3"/>Ma vanyi ndu nggani abǝr vanyi sǝ nga ja, ama aˈyi ja vanyi sǝ mai, ngguta kǝrnyi nga ju mǝl. <verse eid="GAL 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="GAL 6:4"/>Bǝgǝ kalar ndǝ ja dzǝgabiya sǝr mǝla ja. Ma ɗa mǝnahǝu, ǝnggau ja sǝn ɓwasau ǝnga sǝra ji mǝliya ǝnga kǝrnyi, ama aˈyi ja gǝla kǝrnyi ǝnga vanyi ndǝ mai. <verse eid="GAL 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="GAL 6:5"/>Arya tsaˈa nga nyi anǝ kalar ndǝ ja hanggǝr thlǝr nyi.<verse eid="GAL 6:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="GAL 6:6"/>Kalar ndǝra nji highiɓǝr nyi ndǝr Hyal, kǝl ja tǝkǝya sǝ mǝnahǝ kǝra ara ja ǝnga ndǝra highiɓǝ anǝ nyi.<verse eid="GAL 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="GAL 6:7"/>A sara hya ngguta kǝrhyi mai, ndǝr sǝn canǝ nyi dabar anǝ Hyal aˈyi mai. Kalar sǝra ndǝ thlǝkana, ca nga ju gǝm. <verse eid="GAL 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="GAL 6:8"/>Ma ndǝ thlǝkana wu sǝ suna nǝ kumǝr dzau, sǝra ju nda gǝm ca ngǝ tau. Ma ndǝ thlǝkana wu sǝra Mambǝl wu yiwu, sǝra ju nda gǝm ca ngǝ pi kǝra gǝra kuɗau. <verse eid="GAL 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="GAL 6:9"/>Agabangǝ a sara mǝna hǝɗa ǝnga mǝl mǝnahǝkur mai, arya ar pǝci kakalǝ mǝnu nda faˈa sǝ nǝ barka ma mǝn gǝra taˈyi ar lagu. <verse eid="GAL 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="GAL 6:10"/>Arya kau, kalar pǝci kǝra mǝn ǝnga lagu, taˈyi mǝna mǝl mǝnahǝkur anǝ nji patǝu, ja ɗa ma anǝ wazha ama kǝra wu Kǝrsiti.<verse eid="GAL 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Aˈyi Thla Pǝlzha Mai Ama Nggya Mafǝliyangǝ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="GAL 6:11"/>Kabangǝkau, hya tsamiya culi tsǝfǝ dǝdǝgal kǝra yi mǝl anǝ hyi ǝnga pǝla yau! <verse eid="GAL 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="GAL 6:12"/>Nji kǝ wu yiwu kǝl nja thlana hyi pǝlzha kau, ndu yiwu nja lar nda ar viya vanyi sau. Ndu mǝl anǝ hyi abangau, arya ndu hivǝr sa ɓwaɓwatǝ kǝra ndu sa lari arya highiɓǝ ar kǝra wu dladlakǝ nǝ Kǝrsiti. <verse eid="GAL 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="GAL 6:13"/>Alaga njira nji thlana nda pǝlzha ma, nandǝ wu ɓǝlari dlaɗǝ mai. Nanda ndu yiwu nda thlana hyi pǝlzha aga nda hya kǝr abǝr nanda ngǝ sǝwa nji thlana hyi pǝlzha. <verse eid="GAL 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="GAL 6:14"/>Ama alaga kushu nayi wu hyaˈa kǝr mai, kǝl ǝnga wu dladlakǝ nǝ Thlagǝr mǝn Yesu Kǝrsiti. Arya lagur tǝ nyi ar wu dladlakau ngǝ sǝr duniya tǝnakǝr wu yau, nayi tsu a tǝnar yi kǝr ǝnga sǝr duniya. <verse eid="GAL 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="GAL 6:15"/>Pǝlzha, gǝra pǝlzha aˈyi nda sǝ mai, sǝ dǝgal ca ngǝ nda ɗa ndǝ mafǝliyangǝ. <verse eid="GAL 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="GAL 6:16"/>Jamǝkur ǝnga tǝhuɗǝkur nda nggya ǝnga patǝr njira wu nu sǝr ɓǝla kau, nanda ngǝ njir Izirayila nǝ Hyal.<verse eid="GAL 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="GAL 6:17"/>Ayukuɗa nyi wazha ama, a sara vanyi nda ɓǝra fuwa ɗa wu ɗǝnga vanyi sǝ mai, arya mǝcaviɗi kǝra ar dza yi kau, a cabiyari, abǝr nayi nǝ Yesu ngau.<verse eid="GAL 6:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="GAL 6:18"/>Wazha ama, bǝgǝ mayiwakur nǝ Thlagǝr mǝn Yesu Kǝrsiti a nggya ǝnga mambǝlǝr hyi. Amina.<verse eid="GAL 6:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="GAL 6"/>
</usx>
